---
import LegacyLayout from "../layouts/LegacyLayout.astro";
---

<LegacyLayout title="Home" styles={["/css/index.css"]}>
<main>
            <div class="slider">
                <ul class="slides">
                    <li>
                        <img src="/images/math_team_lecture_reduced.jpg" />

                        <div class="caption center-align">
                            <h3>Welcome to the BCA Math Team!</h3>
                            <h5 class="light grey-text text-lighten-3">
                                Official website of the Bergen County Academies Math Team
                            </h5>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <img src="/images/jhmmc_volunteers_reduced.jpeg" />
                        <div class="caption left-align">
                            <h3>Open to any high schoolers</h3>
                            <h5 class="light grey-text text-lighten-3">
                                High school students with with any interest and at any level of math knowledge
                            </h5>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <!-- <li>
                    <img src="https://lorempixel.com/580/250/nature/3">
                    <div class="caption right-align">
                        <h3>Sample text</h3>
                        <h5 class="light grey-text text-lighten-3">Sample text</h5>
                    </div>
                </li> -->
                </ul>
            </div>

            <br />

            <div class="container">
                <h4>Welcome to the BCA Math Team, one of the oldest and largest groups at the Academies.</h4>
                <p>
                    We participate in a variety of national math competitions over the course of the year. Many of them
                    take place at BCA, but we also travel to multiple competitions each year. Past locations we have
                    traveled to include Princeton, Harvard, MIT, Penn State, Carnegie Mellon, Seton Hall, Stanford, and
                    even Beijing and Seoul!
                </p>
                <p>
                    <b>For students:</b> past resources (lecture notes, problem sets, and contests) can be found on our{" "}
                    <a href="/archive.html">archive</a> page.
                </p>

                <section class="blue lighten-5 homepage-updates" aria-labelledby="school-year-updates">
                    <h5 id="school-year-updates">2026-27 Math Team Updates</h5>
                    <p>
                        <b>Registration:</b><br />
                        <a href="https://forms.gle/GURRT9a4jkwGmot19">Mailing list for grades 9-12</a><br />
                        <a href="https://forms.gle/m9yMA5VfT5x3tCiq5">Mailing list for grades 8 and below</a>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <b>High school program:</b> The first meeting is{" "}<span class="meeting-time">Saturday, September 19, from 1:00 to 4:00 PM</span>.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <b>Morning program:</b> The schedule is still being planned, and meetings will begin in
                        mid-to-late October.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <b><a href="https://holbrook.bcamathteam.org/">JHMMC</a>:</b> The competition will be held
                        November 14-15, 2026. Registration will be available shortly.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <!-- <h4>This past meeting (9/14)...</h4>
                <p>
                    For our first math team meeting, we had a warmup problem set which we went over as a group. We then
                    took the Fall Startup math contest, consisting of an individual and a team round. A subset of the
                    materials is available on our <a href="archive.html">archive</a> page.
                </p> -->
                <br />
                <br />
                <br />
                <br />
                <br />
                <br />
            </div>
        </main>
</LegacyLayout>

<style>
    .homepage-updates {
        margin: 1.75rem 0 2rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem 0.75rem;
    }

    .homepage-updates h5 {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .homepage-updates p {
        margin: 0.85rem 0;
    }

    .meeting-time {
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
    }
</style>
